('vq-error-404-easy','vq-error-404','easy','Jaké číslo chyby je na obrázku?','Which error number is shown?','[{"key":0,"cs":"403","en":"403"},{"key":1,"cs":"500","en":"500"},{"key":2,"cs":"404","en":"404"},{"key":3,"cs":"301","en":"301"}]'::jsonb,2,'https://foxey-cz.github.io/GuessTheGame-Web/quizoria/media/vq-error-404.svg','https://foxey-cz.github.io/GuessTheGame-Web/quizoria/media/vq-error-404.svg','FOXEY Arcade — original vector illustration','FOXEY Arcade Original Art (project-owned)'),
('vq-error-404-medium','vq-error-404','medium','Co obvykle znamená HTTP 404?','What does HTTP 404 usually mean?','[{"key":0,"cs":"Příliš mnoho požadavků","en":"Too many requests"},{"key":1,"cs":"Požadovaná stránka nebyla nalezena","en":"The requested page was not found"},{"key":2,"cs":"Připojení je šifrované","en":"The connection is encrypted"},{"key":3,"cs":"Server se právě aktualizuje","en":"The server is updating"}]'::jsonb,1,'https://foxey-cz.github.io/GuessTheGame-Web/quizoria/media/vq-error-404.svg','https://foxey-cz.github.io/GuessTheGame-Web/quizoria/media/vq-error-404.svg','FOXEY Arcade — original vector illustration','FOXEY Arcade Original Art (project-owned)'),
('vq-error-404-hard','vq-error-404','hard','Které tvrzení o chybě 404 je správné?','Which statement about a 404 error is correct?','[{"key":0,"cs":"Server může fungovat, ale požadovaná cesta neexistuje","en":"The server may be working but the requested path is missing"},{"key":1,"cs":"Vždy znamená výpadek elektřiny","en":"It always means a power outage"},{"key":2,"cs":"Znamená platbu kartou","en":"It means a card payment"},{"key":3,"cs":"Znamená úspěšné stažení","en":"It means a successful download"}]'::jsonb,0,'https://foxey-cz.github.io/GuessTheGame-Web/quizoria/media/vq-error-404.svg','https://foxey-cz.github.io/GuessTheGame-Web/quizoria/media/vq-error-404.svg','FOXEY Arcade — original vector illustration','FOXEY Arcade Original Art (project-owned)'),
